From: Deniz Makaraci <bambukdeniz@Denizs-MacBook-Pro.local>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 13:28:05 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] Add incident dashboard and notification server

Server ingests schema-v1 events at the SDK endpoint, folds them into a
fingerprint-indexed incident store (auto-reopens resolved incidents on
new matches, dedupes retries, optional JSON persistence), and re-assesses
with the triage engine on every batch. Slack/Discord webhooks route by
owning team with cooldown and urgent escalation payloads. Dashboard is
zero-build vanilla JS: filtered incident list, detail reports with
assessment evidence and timelines, acknowledge/resolve controls, and a
manual error-report form.

